%2F1890%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E7%9B%B8%E8%BD%AC%E7%A7%BB%E9%95%9C%E9%9D%A2%22%2C%22count%22%3A12%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1273%2Fdetail%22%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1753375673995\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"info\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--info obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h1>武器数据</h1> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__info-table\"><colgroup><col> <col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-avatar\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/09/09/282941837/824d68acde7a81aa0d297683b7e15049_3148444575748982213.png\" alt=\"\"></td> <td class=\"h3\">星级</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-stars\"><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">攻击</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">298</td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">会心</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">13</td></tr></tbody></table> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">意识的律者使用自身权能打造出的神兵利器。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\">与其创造者一样，并没有实体，因此获得了「不是实物」的别名。不具实体，即是千变万化，以一当千。据说，根据实战的需求，「不识时务」能够立刻变化成任何武器的样貌。</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">袭人不意</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:15秒]</span>将砖头砸向敌人，造成200.0％攻击力的范围物理伤害。识之律者使用时，释放该效果并命中敌人时额外回20点能量并对命中的敌人施加0.1秒昏迷与6点眩晕积蓄值，且在爆发状态下获得以下招式：</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\">普通攻击：识之律者融汇诸般武器，连按攻击键变化为使用各种武器，最多十连击，共造成4480％攻击力的物理伤害，但无法通过长按攻击键发动分支攻击—连斩</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">特殊攻击：点按必杀键释放特殊攻击【吾法武天】，吸引大范围内的敌人，造成350％＋500.0％攻击力物理伤害并对被命中的敌人施加0.5昏迷与6点眩晕积蓄值，冷却时间8秒。释放后在场上留下裂痕停留至律者形态结束，处于裂痕上的敌人不会被击退</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\">终结技：点按武器键发动终结技【砖横跋扈】，对大范围内敌人造成750.0％＋100％攻击力的物理伤害<span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">（本次攻击暴击率增加100%）并对被命中的敌人施加6点眩晕积蓄值</span>，发动该攻击同时视为释放必杀技，期间角色触发时滞领域效果，角色、敌人身上的技能效果以及关卡都会停止计时，释放后退出爆发状态且必杀技进入6秒冷却时间</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">诸刃随心</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">爆发状态期间，自身物理伤害提高10.0％。识之律者使用时，若敌人已拥有来自其他角色技能施加的脆弱效果，则精神泯灭领域附加的脆弱效果改为使其受到的来自识之律者的物理伤害提高12.0％，若敌人未拥有来自其他角色技能施加的脆弱效果，则原有施加的脆弱效果不变。【入世出世皆随心】每次触发时持续时间延长为16秒，且爆发状态期间全程触发技能【紫微难能循我意】的全部效果。【敌来盾挡斩刃下】对武器持有者的暴击伤害提高效果变为整场游戏始终生效</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">意识之键</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\">在联机Raid关卡中，角色的物理伤害提高25.0％</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"gainMethod\" data-tmpl=\"general\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-general obc-tmpl__part--gainMethod obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>获取途径</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">补给获取</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">活动补给</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">大伟哥别墅</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(251, 253, 255)\">消耗</span><a href=\"https://bbs.mihoyo.com/bh3/wiki/content/1180/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\" data-type=\"a\" target=\"_blank\">大伟哥黑金卡</a><span style=\"background-color:rgb(251, 253, 255)\">兑换获得</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">材料-消耗品</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">开启<a href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/3513/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\" data-type=\"obc-content\" target=\"_blank\">神之键自选箱</a>兑换获得</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 3;\"> <div data-part=\"material\" data-tmpl=\"stigmata\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-stigmata obc-tmpl__part--material obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>进化材料</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <thead><tr><th>突破等级</th> <th colspan=\"5\">所需材料</th></tr></thead> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">35</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1132/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">三分结晶</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*3</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1890/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">流体合金块</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*1</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1273/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">相转移镜面</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*3</span></div></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">40</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1132/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">三分结晶</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*3</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1890/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">流体合金块</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*2</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1273/detail\"><!----><span 