method obc-tmpl-weapon__role-table\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/09/27/282941837/d173526d7e8c2c2a44046f2d1b4b48ac_6377915233503174419.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>识之律者</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">推荐武器，全方面提升了角色的输出和循环能力，改变了角色爆发状态下的输出流程，提升极大。</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/09/27/282941837/d2bb6e3045b6ee934ba0355c1c82b19a_2310930790846300641.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">物理特性的输出向拳套神之键。提供爆发状态下的物伤。识之律者装备时，使用武器技提供回能，使识之律者在必杀技或爆发状态下的攻击可以获取SP，加快了角色的回转；【诸刃随心】提高了识之律者自身的加成（如【入世出世皆随心】等）的覆盖率，且爆发状态下，获得额外的招式，通过改变后的输出模式，配合【诸刃随心】提供的增伤，大幅提高了角色的输出能力。</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/09/27/282941837/d2bb6e3045b6ee934ba0355c1c82b19a_2310930790846300641.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div>